---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---
<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How ReefMetric makes money — our FTC affiliate disclosure.">
  <section class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brand-2)">Disclosure</p>
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p>ReefMetric is reader-supported. When you buy through links on our site, we may earn an affiliate commission — at no additional cost to you. These are “paid links.”</p>
    <p>Product links can take you to Bulk Reef Supply, Aquarium Specialty, or Amazon. A link to a retailer does not by itself mean that retailer sponsors this site or that a commission will be earned. Commission payments depend on an approved program, tracking, and that program's terms.</p>
    <p>Commissions never influence our rankings or which products we recommend. Our picks use published data, specs, and stated calculations. We recommend the best fit for the stated setup whether or not we earn from it.</p>
    <h2>What a paid link means</h2>
    <p>A paid link is a way for a retailer to credit a publisher for a qualifying purchase. It does not give ReefMetric control over the retailer's price, stock, delivery, returns, or warranty. The retailer sets those terms. Check them on the destination site before paying, especially for equipment with several sizes, revisions, or controller bundles.</p>
    <p>Buttons name the retailer so you can see where you are going. A link may open a product listing or a search for the equipment named on the page. If it opens a search, check the model and included parts before choosing a result. No purchase is required to use our calculators, guides, or comparisons.</p>
    <h2>How to read the rankings</h2>
    <p>Our <a href={url('/how-we-rate')}>rating method</a> explains the published specs and estimates used to compare gear. A ranking is advice about fit for a stated setup, not a customer star rating or a promise that a product will work in every tank. For example, the <a href={url('/reviews/best-protein-skimmers')}>protein skimmer rankings</a> depend on tank size and bioload; the <a href={url('/reviews/best-return-pumps')}>return pump rankings</a> depend on plumbing assumptions.</p>
    <p>Prices shown in a comparison are dated reference figures. Follow the retailer link for the current offer and confirm the exact product. A sale or a shipping charge may change which option is cheapest for you.</p>
    <p>Questions? <a href={url('/about')}>Learn more about how we work</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
